commands
  ?  this menu
  r  re-run the full self test
  a  read the ADC channels once
  t  pulse FW_TRIG0/FW_TRIG1 into InstrumentPort-40
  I  beacon the board serial on the triggers, so a
     capture identifies which board it came from
  i  toggle the instrumentation buffers, which silences
     or restores the 1 Hz FW_TRIG0 heartbeat
  k  10 s clock tick stream, for host-side crystal check
  u  pyControl UART loopback (needs DIO-A shorted to DIO-B)
  B  reboot into BOOTSEL for reflashing
  R  reboot

There is deliberately no command to enable HV_EN or the GPIO
isolation bus switch. Stage 1 cannot energise anything.


